'''Battle Royale''' (バトルロワイヤル ''Batoru Rowaiyaru'', '''Battle Royale''') is the 24th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 3.6 Update|Version 3.6]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Now, by this point in the game, you should have most [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]' [[True Form]]s and [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed Cats]]. If not, then you're in for a ride.

Battle Royale has a habit of taking petty [[Empire of Cats]] enemies and buffing them to formidable strength magnifications. To avoid being knocked off your feet regularly, pay attention to the strength magnifications of these enemies. This sub-chapter as well as every sub-chapter after it will be extremely difficult to beat without any Crazed Cats.
{{LegendDiff|120|140|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Chickful A]]: A mid-ranged [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy that has a chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] cats.

